<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
Page: My Compassion 2 – New Sponsorship Thank You - no payment taken yet

    Description:
    Every payment mode published in Switzerland today is bank-collected -
    eBill, Permanent Order, Postfinance Direct Debit - so none of them takes
    an online payment. There is no provider to redirect to, which the shared
    flow already handles by itself (sponsorship_wizard_submit only shows the
    payment page for a mode with a payment_provider_id, so these go straight
    to the thank-you page). What it does not handle is the copy: the page is
    written for a sponsor who has just paid, and a Swiss sponsor has not.

    This says so, and says what they still have to do, per mode. What each
    mode still expects of them is decided in
    recurring.contract._my2_ch_pending_payment_kind (models/contracts.py).

    Target:
    - my_compassion.my2_new_sponsorship_thank_you_page

    Notes:
    - Nothing is shown for a provider-backed mode (the sponsor really has
      paid) nor for a Write&Pray sponsorship (it never involves a payment, so
      "not yet" would announce one that is never coming). Both cases are the
      empty answer from _my2_ch_pending_payment_kind.
    - Placed above the "Who shall we thank?" form rather than below it, so
      the sponsor reads what happened to their money before being asked for
      one more thing.
-->
<odoo>
  <template
    id="my2_new_sponsorship_thank_you_pending_payment"
    inherit_id="my_compassion.my2_new_sponsorship_thank_you_page"
    name="New Sponsorship Thank You - Payment Still To Come"
  >
    <xpath expr="//div[hasclass('mx-4')]" position="after">
      <t
        t-set="pending_payment_kind"
        t-value="sponsorship._my2_ch_pending_payment_kind()"
      />
      <div
        t-if="pending_payment_kind"
        id="ch_pending_payment_notice"
        class="mb-4 mx-4 p-4 rounded-lg bg-high-eggshell body-small"
      >
        <div class="bold">No payment has been made yet.</div>
        <t t-if="pending_payment_kind == 'ebill'">
                    Your E-Bill connection with Compassion is set up. Your first
                    invoice will arrive in your bank's E-Bill inbox, where you
                    approve it - nothing is debited before you do.
                </t>
        <t t-elif="pending_payment_kind == 'permanent_order'">
                    We will send you the payment details so you can set up the
                    standing order with your bank. Your sponsorship starts as
                    soon as we receive the first payment.
                </t>
        <t t-elif="pending_payment_kind == 'direct_debit'">
                    We will send you the direct debit authorisation to sign and
                    return. Once your bank has it, the monthly amount is
                    collected automatically.
                </t>
        <t t-else="">
                    We will send you the payment details for the method you
                    chose. Your sponsorship starts as soon as we receive the
                    first payment.
                </t>
      </div>
    </xpath>
  </template>
</odoo>
